sec.p:
According to Article 8 of Regulation (EC) No 1831/2003, EFSA, after verifying the particulars and documents submitted by the applicant, shall undertake an assessment in order to determine whether the feed additive complies with the conditions laid down in Article 5. EFSA shall deliver an opinion on the safety for the target animals, consumer, user and the environment and on the efficacy of the feed additive consisting of vitamin B1 as thiamine mononitrate and thiamine hydrochloride when used under the proposed conditions of use (see Section

3.1.3
).
